---
// Flat byte layout of Go struct embedding vs OOP class inheritance object header.
const W = 900;
const H = 276;
---
<figure class="gfemb">
  <div class="gfemb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Memory byte layout proving Go struct embedding flattens embedded fields inline inside a single contiguous 24-byte allocation with compile-time method promotion.">
      {/* Left panel: Flat memory layout */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="446" height="248" rx="10" class="gfemb-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gfemb-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Contiguous byte layout (zero parent pointers!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Bộ nhớ phẳng liền mạch (0 con trỏ lớp cha)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="58" width="414" height="58" rx="6" class="gfemb-box" />
      <text x="44" y="78" class="gfemb-code">type Account struct {'{'} Logger; Mutex; ID, Bal int {'}'}</text>
      <text x="44" y="100" class="gfemb-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Logger (0B) + Mutex (8B) + ID (8B) + Bal (8B) = 24B flat</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Logger (0B) + Mutex (8B) + ID (8B) + Bal (8B) = 24B phẳng</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="132" width="132" height="52" rx="6" class="gfemb-box is-ok" />
      <text x="96" y="153" text-anchor="middle" class="gfemb-b-ok">offset +0 (8B)</text>
      <text x="96" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="gfemb-m">sync.Mutex</text>

      <rect x="171" y="132" width="132" height="52" rx="6" class="gfemb-box" />
      <text x="237" y="153" text-anchor="middle" class="gfemb-b">offset +8 (8B)</text>
      <text x="237" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="gfemb-m">ID (int)</text>

      <rect x="312" y="132" width="132" height="52" rx="6" class="gfemb-box" />
      <text x="378" y="153" text-anchor="middle" class="gfemb-b">offset +16 (8B)</text>
      <text x="378" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="gfemb-m">Balance (int64)</text>

      <rect x="30" y="198" width="414" height="48" rx="6" class="gfemb-box" />
      <text x="44" y="219" class="gfemb-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>a.Info("hi") compiles straight to a.Logger.Info("hi")</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>a.Info("hi") được compiler tự mở rộng thành a.Logger.Info("hi")</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="237" class="gfemb-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Inside Logger.Info(), receiver is STILL Logger, NOT *Account.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trong Logger.Info(), receiver vẫn là Logger, không có đa hình lớp cha.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Caveat rules (never embed Mutex publicly) */}
      <rect x="476" y="14" width="410" height="248" rx="10" class="gfemb-card" />
      <text x="492" y="42" class="gfemb-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Safety rule: embed helpers privately</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Quy tắc an toàn: tránh lộ lock ra API public</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="492" y="58" width="378" height="86" rx="6" class="gfemb-box is-red" />
      <text x="506" y="79" class="gfemb-b-red">Pitfall: embedding sync.Mutex directly</text>
      <text x="506" y="99" class="gfemb-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Exposes acct.Lock() &amp; acct.Unlock() as public methods!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tự động biến acct.Lock() thành public để caller khóa bừa!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="506" y="118" class="gfemb-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Copying Account copies Mutex state -&gt; instant deadlock bug.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Copy struct lây luôn trạng thái đã Lock -&gt; kẹt deadlock.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="492" y="158" width="378" height="88" rx="6" class="gfemb-box is-ok" />
      <text x="506" y="179" class="gfemb-b-ok">Fix: named unexported field mu sync.Mutex</text>
      <text x="506" y="199" class="gfemb-code">type Account struct {'{'} mu Mutex; Bal int {'}'}</text>
      <text x="506" y="220" class="gfemb-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Encapsulates lock inside Account; go vet flags copies.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giấu khóa trong Account; go vet báo lỗi ngay nếu lỡ copy.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Struct embedding lays embedded fields directly inside contiguous memory with compile-time method forwarding—never inheritance, never vtables. Name lock fields explicitly (mu sync.Mutex) instead of embedding them publicly.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nhúng struct đặt thẳng dữ liệu vào cùng khối nhớ liên tục kèm chuyển tiếp hàm lúc biên dịch — không có đa kế thừa hay bảng vtable. Với sync.Mutex, hãy đặt tên trường rõ ràng mu sync.Mutex thay vì nhúng ẩn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gfemb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gfemb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gfemb svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 680px; height: auto; }
  .gfemb text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gfemb-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gfemb-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gfemb-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gfemb-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfemb-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfemb-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfemb-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfemb-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gfemb-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfemb-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfemb-code { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 10.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfemb-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 10.5px; }
  .gfemb figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
